{"id":2242,"date":"2026-08-26T23:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T23:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=2242"},"modified":"2026-08-27T05:21:02","modified_gmt":"2026-08-27T05:21:02","slug":"grid-guides","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/layout-tools\/grid-guides\/","title":{"rendered":"Grid Guides"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Grid Guides<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-2262\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/GridGuides.webp\" alt=\"Grid Guides\" width=\"131\" height=\"138\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/GridGuides.webp 872w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/GridGuides-284x300.webp 284w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/GridGuides-768x810.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 131px) 100vw, 131px\" \/><\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">Grid Guides overlay a regular pattern of intersecting lines across your canvas, giving you a precise visual reference for aligning elements and maintaining consistent spacing throughout your layout. The grid is non-printing &#8211; it is only visible in the editor and never appears in your exported or printed output.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Opening Grid Guide Setting<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-2252\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/t-1.webp\" alt=\"Opening Grid Guide Setting\" width=\"220\" height=\"172\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/t-1.webp 437w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/t-1-300x235.webp 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 220px) 100vw, 220px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Go to <strong>Page Design &gt; Guides &gt; Grid and Baseline Guides<\/strong>.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">The customisation modal opens as a draggable window so it can be repositioned while you preview changes on the canvas live.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p align=\"center\"><img decoding=\"async\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px;\" src=\"https:\/\/github.com\/user-attachments\/assets\/5d2cd84b-d906-4ed1-a9a6-5d9138d5faee\" alt=\"Open Publisher Grid Guides settings\" \/><\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">What You Can Customise<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-2266\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/GridAndBaselineGuides-1.webp\" alt=\"What You Can Customise\" width=\"289\" height=\"388\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/GridAndBaselineGuides-1.webp 257w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/GridAndBaselineGuides-1-223x300.webp 223w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 289px) 100vw, 289px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Grid spacing &#8211;<\/strong> Set the distance between grid lines to any value that suits your layout. Tighter spacing gives you greater precision for positioning small elements; wider spacing works well for block-based, modular layouts.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Grid colour &#8211;<\/strong> Change the colour of the grid lines to something that contrasts clearly against your page background without becoming visually distracting during design work.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Locking &amp; Clearing Guides<\/span><\/h3>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-2257\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/LockingAndClearingGuides.webp\" alt=\"Locking &amp; Clearing Guides\" width=\"130\" height=\"133\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/LockingAndClearingGuides.webp 421w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/LockingAndClearingGuides-292x300.webp 292w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 130px) 100vw, 130px\" \/><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Lock Guides &#8211;<\/strong> Freezes all guides in place via<br \/>\n<strong>Page Design &gt; Guides &gt; Lock Guides<\/strong>, preventing accidental movement during active design work.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Clear Guides &#8211;<\/strong> Removes all placed guides from the canvas instantly via <strong>Page Design &gt; Guides &gt; Clear Guides<\/strong>.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><\/h3>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Grid Guides Grid Guides overlay a regular pattern of intersecting lines across your canvas, giving you a precise visual reference for aligning elements and maintaining consistent spacing throughout your layout. The grid is non-printing &#8211; it is only visible in the editor and never appears in your exported or printed output. Opening Grid Guide Setting [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":2262,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[20],"class_list":["post-2242","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-layout-tools"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/2242","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=2242"}],"version-history":[{"count":23,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/2242\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":2275,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/2242\/revisions\/2275"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/2262"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=2242"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"knowledgebase_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase_cat?post=2242"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}